674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dtKrAHUq2EkQ7kNvwFVhPAV&_nc_oc=AdoTiaidJa1ioz0KMmVfvXg8vwhDyzO5QPM7tJ1drWmm-uuaYewqYLZrrWJk-3ai4eg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFXL9nv3ny2x83vmU26mjr6vhm3HkIOn-ThBfeSYwGTLQ&oe=6A7F26D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KvmJbRsdEN8Q7kNvwG4KgyZ&_nc_oc=Adom_Q3t8kM_E_RUF9OQVZwYbOzsRgLYKVw_UtKhHmHyPIAlcEp3BTI3PbAZfK3U3gQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE2cSnRcgM3a1CiB-FkB0vWeSBh4BEUd8oH2pUH27wliw&oe=6A7EF756"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1Lslz5nQoVYQ7kNvwGVg2SX&_nc_oc=AdqWmKdTd9G8I25vu-m7sPdEmdzLJh8XqmUZ7EqFFqKkGS_j07CDpV40rR_IBSKGHPI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEDqIVHA24zZYfL9cJnyeIqaWtjQDbwZ0b3QDdBvjwTYA&oe=6A7EF371"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip